{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in <strong>Air Dash: Sky Racing Simulator</strong>, the ultimate arcade-style flight racing experience. Push the throttle, master the controls, and outfly your rivals across a variety of thrilling maps and high-speed challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2708\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Racing</strong> \u2013 Compete with friends locally in fast-paced split-screen mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps &amp; Tracks</strong> \u2013 From city skylines to mountain valleys and open seas, every race brings a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garage &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade a wide selection of planes. Personalize your aircraft with unique skins and tuning options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Drift through sharp turns, boost through checkpoints, and soar through obstacles at breakneck speeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade &amp; Simulator Blend</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, but with enough depth for flight sim fans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing records solo or battling side by side with a friend, <strong>Air Dash</strong> delivers the perfect mix of speed, competition, and sky-high adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to <strong>dash through the skies</strong> and become the ultimate air racer?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538320?t=1761127506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761127506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538320/ddf085778a0b60f5e3cba8b6459ce271db117bfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761127506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s